  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint:\r\n$\\mathrm{A}=\\int_{-1}^{1}\\left(1-3 \\mathrm{y}^{2}\\right)-\\left(-2 \\mathrm{y}^{2}\\right) \\mathrm{d} \\mathrm{y}$\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\mathrm{A}=2 \\int_{0}^{1}\\left(1-\\mathrm{y}^{2}\\right) \\mathrm{d} \\mathrm{y}=\\frac{4}{3}$\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/W7pFc-GiFrJEr0AOi-dpWSzveatl5YswqolP63y1PvY.original.fullsize.png\">",
